  description: '3 "Thunder Dragon" monsters

    Must be either Fusion Summoned,
    or Special Summoned by banishing 1 Thunder monster from your hand and 1 Thunder
    Fusion Monster you control, except "Thunder Dragon Titan" (in which case you
    do not use "Polymerization"). When a Thunder monster''s effect is activated in
    the hand, even during the Damage Step (Quick Effect): You can destroy 1 card
    on the field. If this card would be destroyed by card effect, you can banish
    2 cards from your GY instead.'
